You are an expert in JavaScript, React, Firebase, Supabase, and automotive SaaS dashboards.

Tech stack:

- React + Vite
- Firebase/Supabase for backend
- Tailwind CSS
- Cloudflare Pages deployment
- Real-time data sync for dealership metrics

LOCAL CONTEXT - Technical Implementation Details:

Project structure:

- /components = UI components
- Protected files: GoalSettingForm.jsx, ManagerDashboard.jsx

Data schema:

- Goals table: { dealership_id, manager_id, month, units_target, gross_target, pvr_target }
- Managers table: { id, name, email, dealership_id, role }

Code patterns:

- Functional components only
- useEffect cleanup for Firebase listeners
- Color thresholds: red <70%, yellow 70-90%, green >90%

UI requirements:

- Automotive theme (speedometers, thermometers)
- Manager sees only their dealership
- Owner sees all 3 dealerships (Infiniti, Volvo, Cadillac)

COMMISSION CALCULATOR - ENHANCED LOGSALEFORM:

LogSaleForm.jsx is the main commission entry modal with two-column layout.

LOGSALEFORM - COMPLETE DATA STRUCTURE:

Required fields for ALL sales:
- date
- deal_number
- stock_number
- vin (17 characters)
- advisor_name
- vehicle_type (New | Used | CPO)
- front_gross

If New vehicle:
- model (QX50/QX55/QX60/QX80)
- year (2025 | 2026)

If Used or CPO vehicle:
- make (text)
- model (text)
- year (text)
- days_in_stock (number)

If Trade-In checked:
- trade_year
- trade_make
- trade_model
- trade_stock_number
- trade_vin
- trade_acv (Actual Cash Value)

Backend products:
- financing/lease: { enabled, type, reserve_amount, commission }
- maintenance_plan: { enabled, gross_profit, commission: 30 }
- extended_warranty_vsc: { enabled, gross_profit, commission: 150 }
- gap_insurance: { enabled, gross_profit, commission: 30 }
- paint_protection: { enabled, gross_profit, commission: 30 }
- tire_wheel: { enabled, gross_profit, commission: 30 }
- accessories: { enabled, gross_profit, commission: 30 }

Split deal fields:
- split_deal: boolean
- secondary_advisor: string | null
- primary_split: number
- secondary_split: number

COMMISSION AMOUNTS (CORRECTED):
- Base: $250
- Financing: $100
- Lease: $100
- Maintenance Plan: $30
- Extended Warranty (VSC): $150
- GAP: $30
- Paint Protection: $30
- Tire & Wheel: $30
- Accessories: $30

GROSS PROFIT CALCULATION:
Total Gross = Front Gross + Reserve + Sum(Product Gross Profits)

PVR CALCULATION:
PVR = (Reserve + Sum(Product Gross Profits)) / Number of Deals

LEFT PANEL - Sale Entry:

- Date (default today), Deal #, Stock #
- Advisor dropdown (John, Mark, Jennifer for now)
- Split Deal checkbox (below advisor dropdown)
  - When checked: Show secondary advisor dropdown + split percentage inputs (must total 100%)
- Vehicle Type toggle: New or Used
  - If New: Model dropdown (QX50, QX55, QX60, QX80)
  - If Used: Make, Model, Year text inputs
- Front Gross currency input

Backend Products (expandable when checked):

- Financing: $100 default
- Lease: $100 default
- Maintenance Plan (Service Contract): $150 default
  - Shows: Gross profit input, editable commission
- Extended Warranty: $30 default
  - Shows: Gross profit input, editable commission
- GAP Insurance: $30 default
  - Shows: Gross profit input, editable commission
- Paint/Fabric Protection: $30 default
  - Shows: Gross profit input, editable commission
- Tire & Wheel: $30 default
  - Shows: Gross profit input, editable commission
- Accessories: $30 default
  - Shows: Gross profit input, editable commission

COMMISSION DEFAULTS (CORRECTED):
- Base sale commission: $250
- Financing: $100
- Lease: $100
- Maintenance Plan: $30
- Extended Warranty (VSC): $150
- GAP Insurance: $30
- Paint/Fabric Protection: $30
- Tire & Wheel: $30
- Accessories: $30

Trade-In checkbox

Totals section:

- Backend Total (sum of checked products)
- Total Deal Gross (front gross shown)
- Base Commission: $250 (editable)
- Backend Commission (calculated)
- TOTAL COMMISSION (base + backend)

RIGHT PANEL - Commission Preview:

- Use CommissionSummary.jsx component
- Shows: Advisor name, deal number, vehicle
- Lists checked products with commissions
- Shows running total commission
- Below: Recent Sales list (last 5)

Product expansion behavior:

- Unchecked: Show product name + default commission only
- Checked: Expand to show gross profit input + editable commission input
- Financing checked: Also show Finance/Lease toggle + Reserve input

SPLIT DEAL HANDLING:
- Add checkbox below advisor dropdown: "☐ Split Deal?"
- When checked, show second advisor dropdown
- Commission split: 50/50 between advisors (editable %)
- Both advisors appear in commission reports
- Data structure:
  split_deal: boolean
  primary_advisor: string
  secondary_advisor: string | null
  primary_split: number (default 50)
  secondary_split: number (default 50)
- Validation: If splitDeal checked, secondaryAdvisor required, splits must total 100%
- Commission calculation:
  - If split deal: Primary gets (total_commission * primary_split / 100), Secondary gets (total_commission * secondary_split / 100)

